@host = http://localhost:5171/api/ClaimableItems
# A token from the browser after signing in (local storage), without "Bearer ".
@token = paste-a-token-here
@vin = a-vin-the-vehicle-lookup-knows

### Several countries are configured: without one the lookup answers CountryRequired with the (hashed) list.
GET {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/vin-lookup/{{vin}}?mileage=12000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The vehicle and its contract menu, priced for a country from that list, with its transfer rate
GET {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/vin-lookup/{{vin}}?mileage=12000&countryId=<hashed country ID>&transferRate=1.25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contracts
GET {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract?$top=5&$orderby=StartDate desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A draft. Lines need only the menu line key (and a duration on periodic lines); the server takes everything
### else from the menu. Use keys from the lookup above.
POST {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "VIN": "{{vin}}",
  "CustomerName": "Sample Customer",
  "CustomerPhone": "+000 000 0000",
  "ContractType": "PurchasedServiceContract",
  "Mileage": 12000,
  "StartDate": "2026-11-01",
  "Duration": 2,
  "DurationUnit": "Years",
  "PriceIncrement": 0.05,
  "Country": { "Value": "<hashed country ID>" },
  "TransferRate": 1.25,
  "IsDraft": true,
  "Lines": [
    { "MenuLineKey": "<a periodic line key>", "LineType": "Periodic", "Duration": 6, "DurationUnit": "Months" }
  ]
}

### Issue a saved draft (its ID from the POST above)
POST {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/<id>/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel one line, then the whole contract
POST {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/<id>/lines/<lineId>/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Reason": "Serviced elsewhere" }

###
POST {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/<id>/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Reason": "Customer withdrew" }

### A print link for an issued contract (open the returned URL)
GET {{host}}/ClaimableItemContract/print-token/<id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
